hat did not.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]provider_drain.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provider-drain planning and execution engine[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]engine: select the agents a disabled provider stranded, classify each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one's reroute or refusal through the existing restart and launch-guard [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machinery, and execute the moves.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase agent drain command and durable operation[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the `sase agent drain` subcommand with preview, confirmation, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]receipt, and JSON envelope, and register it as the `agent.drain` durable[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]operation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Automatic drain on a usage-limit disable[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]auto[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto: gate the feature behind a beta flag, submit a drain proc when a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]usage-limit disable wins its first-writer window, and make that drain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]own the single enriched usage-limit notification.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch Control relaunch prompt after a manual disable[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: after a manual hard disable in the Models panel, offer a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single-keypress relaunch chooser and submit the drain as a durable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked proc.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end drill and reference documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]soak[dim] · [dim][/dim]after auto, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]soak: prove the whole loop through the fakey provider end to end and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document draining in the LLM provider reference.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-su","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-su.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-83ed2cdba5cee3e35e6c722600ab495f","started_at":"2026-08-24T15:04:00.850533+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"91f1a043fd399f424185d06349ec656422ee284ec348147646f3b624bfe90bb3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.5--mon-1/chat.md","size_bytes":42327},"commits":{"digest":"b12c8babfd323b42cbb1126d816d3b7d6c303a103da52d92d6634171c808b554","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.5--mon-1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b10fa333da2a46cd7be9d1ab62df9ea9943d55df7f959456461b9538ed7d66e2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.5--mon-1/meta.json","size_bytes":643},"state":{"digest":"0d2201cf3a89f9f51c1e0079e891916922f850f0f2320b4262e2eb8aa4dc99cf","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.5--mon-1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-su.5--mon-1","local_name":"sase-su.5--mon-1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-su","agent_clan_generation":"20260824110331",